Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Planet Iscandar... An Earth-type planet whose surface is eighty percent water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crew of the Yamato. This is Okita, your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We have finally reached Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... Iscandar lies before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As your captain, I have just one thing I'd like to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you... That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar will now guide the Yamato to the planet's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Surface temperature is 27 degrees. Air pressure is 1,023 hectopascals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,On the Beaufort scale, the wind is 2, to south. The sea is calm, and the sky is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We will return Yurisha. Kodai and Niimi, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too, Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The city is very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she thought Mori was Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She lost her life on Mars, bringing us the Wave Motion Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth owes her its survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you used the Wave Motion Energy as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Executive Officer Shiro Sanada,\Nhere on the Captain's behalf. She is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Information Officer Kaoru Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha, tell me what you have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall speak with the people from Earth afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she said we can't have the Cosmo Reverse System.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean she wants everyone on Earth to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I heard, she simply wants some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it's an insult!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she really give it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's uneasy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they are... Everyone was happy we'd finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your feet on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...Is what the Captain would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Medic Harada has a suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoshina, can you swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice idea, Makoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the sea is right here! We need to let off some steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Kato? Isn't he coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,High... Too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shino...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nature's so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships belong on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... So Lord Desler has passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Yamato saved us. We have no further issues with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do not, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is the great unification of Garmillas and Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible... Our ideals are too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our task is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall fulfill your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you that I will grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will bring peace to all the planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I save the humans, they'll follow the same path you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would add that it was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the cannon that uses Wave Motion Energy which saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can handle the rest on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give the Cosmo Reverse System to the Earthlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am considering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They are not like the Iscandarians, or the Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato used the Wave Motion Gun in self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The scent of the sea... When did I last smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to take this odor back...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell of salt air can be replicated artificially.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a boring little robot, you know? I'll teach you to drink sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a seventy-eight percent chance of causing a system error.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotten cold. This is a night for hot sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I understand that they could not have made it so far otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And that they used the power to save their enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the will to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I must tell them about you. She was here, as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I do, I'll never see you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)}This planet is too sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these flowers called?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Will flowers like these bloom on Earth again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In the language of flowers, they mean "hidden life" and "hidden emotion."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden life?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When a planet bears life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,its matter, and its life forms' evolutionary memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.94,0:13:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,exist as a Wave Motion, beyond time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The planet's element, matter that contains its emotions, releases those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Without that element here, the Cosmo Reverser cannot be completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to save the Earth, was for you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Matter that contains the planet's emotions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you suppose they'll keep us waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll even give it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, let us have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but may I ask what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Starsha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to give you the Cosmo Reverser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,An element?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is required for use as an element?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In... In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remake this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Yamato itself will become\Nthe system for the Cosmo Reverser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I must simply pray my decision was the correct one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We made the hand of salvation you offered us, into a weapon of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We are well aware of the gravity of this deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What you call the Wave Motion Gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:15:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We were the first to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar once used its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to stain the Large Magellanic Cloud with blood, to forge a mighty empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,More than any other, we know the terror of that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So we never gave the technology to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That you will never repeat our foolish act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You... Susumu Kodai, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar's people sleep below.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, save the two of us, is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine you realized this once you saw the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This planet is the only one that need suffer this sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my brother's name here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He was on board a Garmillan prisoner-transport ship
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that crashed on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They were carrying him as a bio-sample of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was the only one to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to hide him from Garmillas. But his body was already...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn't save anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Captain of the Cosmo Navy Destroyer Yukikaze, Mamoru Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was captured by Garmillans, and was being transported as an experimental sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When the ship crashed, I was saved by an Iscandarian woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And she told me that a ship from Earth was heading here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're hearing this message, you must have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could return to Earth with you, aboard your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But it appears I will not last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I die, there are two things I wish to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is that we can come to an understanding with the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I arrived, I have learned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will not forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And second, I want you to tell my brother, Susumu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu, live for me, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Live, and see the Earth when it's become blue once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for your safe voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,May you return safely to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, Kodai passed away here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He sleeps peacefully. Not in the coldness of space, but here, in this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return, Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was his wish and our task.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I shall go to Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I shall assist the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki, this is a sign of the bond between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden life... Hidden emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We share a mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now finish reception of the Cosmo Reverser and return to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:22:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my other self.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Mamoru...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.40,0:25:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With Iscandar behind it, the Yamato hurries back to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They arrive at the Balun gate, hoping to speed up their return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But there, they see that man... Their enemy. Can they see a future beyond him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Forever War.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.93,0:26:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 143 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:49.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:56.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:02.24,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:08.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:14.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.62,0:23:20.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:26.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:32.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:38.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:42.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:45.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:47.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.11,0:23:50.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:54.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:57.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:24:03.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If you have nothing special
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:09.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Only the strength to yearn for it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.97,0:24:16.14,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bound to the limits of time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:27.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Create the trace of a miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.25,0:24:43.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.21,0:24:46.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:49.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:51.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.85,0:24:55.60,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.60,0:24:59.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.23,0:25:01.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.77,0:25:05.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:07.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Together with you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:14.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:29.80,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1202,840)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(2000,2000)}Episode 24
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:29.80,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1087,1073)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(2000,2000)}The Distant Promised Land
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.99,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Welcome home, Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.49,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}And you, as well, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.70,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}No, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.16,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Mori Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.62,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}She is an Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.87,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Rud Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.21,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Irun Yurisha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
